om/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc14b85.jpg"}, {"id": 1880790, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc14b86.jpg"}, {"id": 1880791, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc14b87.jpg"}], "slug": "betrayal-banquet", "storyline": "A grand royal banquet is about to begin, and ten kings are waiting to be served. Players take on the role of royal servants who must cooperate to prepare, cook, and serve meals before time runs out. Hidden among them are Betrayers whose objective is to secretly poison the kings without exposing themselves. While completing cooking tasks together, players must also observe suspicious behavior, discuss accusations, and uncover the traitors before the banquet ends in disaster.", "summary": "Betrayal Banquet is an indie medieval multiplayer party game that combines cooking simulation with social deduction. Players take on the role of royal servants, preparing and serving meals for the kings while racing to complete orders before time runs out. At the same time, hidden Betrayers secretly work to poison the feast without revealing their identity. Every player must decide who to trust, watch for suspicious behavior, and work together to protect the banquet before it's too late.\n\nGenres: Social Deduction, Party, Cooking Simulation, Multiplayer, Co-op.", "themes": [{"id": 22, "name": "Historical"}, {"id": 23, "name": "Stealth"}, {"id": 40, "name": "Party"}, {"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/betrayal-banquet", "videos": [{"id": 190446, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "BfZ2b-UCoNU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BfZ2b-UCoNU", "title": "Betrayal Banquet | Official Gameplay Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/BfZ2b-UCoNU/fhddefault.jpg"}]}